<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.RotTarget(Rotation: rotation, LeeWay: number): number`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer llRotTarget(rotation Rotation, float LeeWay);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>This function is to have the script know when it has reached a rotation.</p>
  <p>It registers a <b>rot</b> with a <b>error</b> that triggers <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/At_rot_target" target="_blank">at_rot_target</a> and <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Not_at_rot_target" target="_blank">not_at_rot_target</a> events continuously until unregistered.</p>
  <p>Returns a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Integer/handle" target="_blank">handle</a> (an <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Integer" target="_blank">integer</a>) to unregister the target with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlRotTargetRemove" target="_blank">llRotTargetRemove</a></p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>rotation</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>rotation</span></td>
          <td>Rotation / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/rot" target="_blank">rot</a></td>
          <td>target rotation</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>float</span></td>
          <td>LeeWay / error</td>
          <td>angle in radians, defines when <b>rot</b> has been reached</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

